# A padded long list: at its top the padding shows under the header; a
# wheel past its end lands at the true end (rows and padding-bottom), where
# reachend grows it; back to the top. A padded transcript follows its true
# end as lines come, and as its padding-bottom alone grows. Requests on the
# long list align within its scroll padding: the first row's start is the
# very top, row 30's end sits above the tab bar.
# Change scroll padding without travel, then content padding, then change
# scroll padding and request alignment in the same action.
tap taller
tap startof
tap inset
tap startof
tap top
tap collapse
tap top

# Row 30 is visible below 40 points, then covered by a taller scroll padding.
# Collapsing and requesting nearest together must retain the original offset.
tap collapse
tap taller
tap near
tap top

wheel long 1500
wheel long 9000
wheel long -40000
tap say
tap say
tap grow
tap top
tap endof
